# Food REGROWS where it grew, yet the wave forgets a place the moment the morsel is gone, so the agent either circles a patch blindly (observer, world 7) or abandons it for good. A trap-line forager: a LARDER channel remembers for a long time every cell where a morsel was seen, and a RIPE clock on each cell is reset where the agent walks and grows back slowly, so a remembered place calls again only after it has had time to regrow. This feeds a FOOD wave kept separate from the EXPLORE wave (the split that held up on holdout, #7: 16.0), so the agent explores new country while nothing is ripe and returns along a route of ripened spots when it is.

channel source
channel solid
channel free
channel thing
channel scent
channel here
channel value
channel void: init 0
channel larder: init 0
channel ripe: init 0
channel confinement
channel food
channel explore

# Where food has been seen, remembered for a long time.
rule remember:
  when 1
  set larder = clamp(max(thing, 0.9995 * larder), 0, 1)

# Regrowth clock: reset where I walk (I ate or saw it bare), grows back slowly.
rule ripen:
  when 1
  set ripe = where(max(here, max8(here)) > 0, 0, clamp(ripe + 0.003, 0, 1))

# How much undiscovered country surrounds a cell, diffused and remembered.
rule unknown_mass:
  when 1
  set void = clamp(0.7 * avg8(void) + 0.3 * (1 - free) * (1 - solid), 0, 1)

# Local confinement.
rule calc_conf:
  when 1
  set confinement = sum8(solid)

# Food wave: seen and smelled food, plus remembered places that have ripened.
rule food_wave:
  when 1
  set food = max(max(thing, where(scent > 0, source, 0), 0.6 * larder * ripe) / (1 + 0.5 * confinement), max(0.94 * max4(food), 0.916214 * max8(food))) * (1 - solid * (1 - leak))

# Explore wave: frontier marks weighted by the unknown behind them.
rule explore_wave:
  when 1
  set explore = max(where(scent + thing > 0, 0, source) * (0.5 + 1.5 * void) / (1 + 0.5 * confinement), max(0.94 * max4(explore), 0.916214 * max8(explore))) * (1 - solid * (1 - leak))

# The stronger want leads.
rule decide:
  when 1
  set value = max(food, explore)
